@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `il-interpretation-time`

-- The brief's worked cases, each run three ways: with no rest days, with Saturdays as the days of rest, and with
-- Fridays and Saturdays. The two calendars are ILLUSTRATIONS supplied by this file as the module's input; they
-- are not a statement of any Israeli calendar, and no holiday is in them.
-- Every expected value was decided from s 10 (and the weekday of the nominal last day, checked on a calendar)
-- before the module was run: see NOTES.md section 0. The #EVAL lines print the values quoted in NOTES.md.

§ `Worked cases`

-- 2020-01-04 was a Saturday, so a day is a Saturday when its day count is a multiple of seven from that one.
GIVEN day IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Saturdays are days of rest` day MEANS
    ((Day day MINUS Day (YMD 2020 1 4)) MODULO 7) EQUALS 0

GIVEN day IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Fridays and Saturdays are days of rest` day MEANS
    ((Day day MINUS Day (YMD 2020 1 4)) MODULO 7) EQUALS 0 OR ((Day day MINUS Day (YMD 2020 1 4)) MODULO 7) EQUALS 6

`no days of rest` MEANS `days of rest, recess or holiday listed in` EMPTY

§§ `Three years from the day 2025-07-16 (s 10(b)): the nominal last day is Sunday 2028-07-16`

#EVAL `s 10 — the last day of a period of` 3 `years from the day` (YMD 2025 7 16)
#ASSERT (`s 10(b), (c) — the last day of a period of` 3 `years after an event on` (YMD 2025 7 16) `, when days of rest, recess or holiday are` `no days of rest`) EQUALS YMD 2028 7 16
#ASSERT (`s 10(b), (c) — the last day of a period of` 3 `years after an event on` (YMD 2025 7 16) `, when days of rest, recess or holiday are` `Saturdays are days of rest`) EQUALS YMD 2028 7 16
#ASSERT (`s 10(b), (c) — the last day of a period of` 3 `years after an event on` (YMD 2025 7 16) `, when days of rest, recess or holiday are` `Fridays and Saturdays are days of rest`) EQUALS YMD 2028 7 16

§§ `Five years from the day 2025-01-15 (s 10(b)): the nominal last day is Tuesday 2030-01-15`

#EVAL `s 10 — the last day of a period of` 5 `years from the day` (YMD 2025 1 15)
#ASSERT (`s 10(b), (c) — the last day of a period of` 5 `years after an event on` (YMD 2025 1 15) `, when days of rest, recess or holiday are` `no days of rest`) EQUALS YMD 2030 1 15
#ASSERT (`s 10(b), (c) — the last day of a period of` 5 `years after an event on` (YMD 2025 1 15) `, when days of rest, recess or holiday are` `Saturdays are days of rest`) EQUALS YMD 2030 1 15
#ASSERT (`s 10(b), (c) — the last day of a period of` 5 `years after an event on` (YMD 2025 1 15) `, when days of rest, recess or holiday are` `Fridays and Saturdays are days of rest`) EQUALS YMD 2030 1 15

§§ `Five years from the day 2025-09-01 (s 10(b)): the nominal last day is Sunday 2030-09-01`

#EVAL `s 10 — the last day of a period of` 5 `years from the day` (YMD 2025 9 1)
#ASSERT (`s 10(b), (c) — the last day of a period of` 5 `years after an event on` (YMD 2025 9 1) `, when days of rest, recess or holiday are` `no days of rest`) EQUALS YMD 2030 9 1
#ASSERT (`s 10(b), (c) — the last day of a period of` 5 `years after an event on` (YMD 2025 9 1) `, when days of rest, recess or holiday are` `Saturdays are days of rest`) EQUALS YMD 2030 9 1
#ASSERT (`s 10(b), (c) — the last day of a period of` 5 `years after an event on` (YMD 2025 9 1) `, when days of rest, recess or holiday are` `Fridays and Saturdays are days of rest`) EQUALS YMD 2030 9 1

§§ `Thirty days from the day 2026-01-01 (s 10(a)): the nominal last day is Saturday 2026-01-31`

#EVAL `s 10(a) — the last day of a period of` 30 `days from` (YMD 2026 1 1)
#ASSERT (`s 10(a), (c) — the last day of a period of` 30 `days from` (YMD 2026 1 1) `, when days of rest, recess or holiday are` `no days of rest`) EQUALS YMD 2026 1 31
#ASSERT (`s 10(a), (c) — the last day of a period of` 30 `days from` (YMD 2026 1 1) `, when days of rest, recess or holiday are` `Saturdays are days of rest`) EQUALS YMD 2026 2 1
#ASSERT (`s 10(a), (c) — the last day of a period of` 30 `days from` (YMD 2026 1 1) `, when days of rest, recess or holiday are` `Fridays and Saturdays are days of rest`) EQUALS YMD 2026 2 1

§§ `Two years from the day 2024-02-28 (s 10(b)): the nominal last day is Saturday 2026-02-28`

#EVAL `s 10 — the last day of a period of` 2 `years from the day` (YMD 2024 2 28)
#ASSERT (`s 10(b), (c) — the last day of a period of` 2 `years after an event on` (YMD 2024 2 28) `, when days of rest, recess or holiday are` `no days of rest`) EQUALS YMD 2026 2 28
#ASSERT (`s 10(b), (c) — the last day of a period of` 2 `years after an event on` (YMD 2024 2 28) `, when days of rest, recess or holiday are` `Saturdays are days of rest`) EQUALS YMD 2026 3 1
#ASSERT (`s 10(b), (c) — the last day of a period of` 2 `years after an event on` (YMD 2024 2 28) `, when days of rest, recess or holiday are` `Fridays and Saturdays are days of rest`) EQUALS YMD 2026 3 1

§§ `One year from the day 2024-02-29 (s 10(b)): February 2025 lacks the 29th; the nominal last day is Friday 2025-02-28`

#EVAL `s 10 — the last day of a period of` 1 `years from the day` (YMD 2024 2 29)
#ASSERT (`s 10(b), (c) — the last day of a period of` 1 `years after an event on` (YMD 2024 2 29) `, when days of rest, recess or holiday are` `no days of rest`) EQUALS YMD 2025 2 28
#ASSERT (`s 10(b), (c) — the last day of a period of` 1 `years after an event on` (YMD 2024 2 29) `, when days of rest, recess or holiday are` `Saturdays are days of rest`) EQUALS YMD 2025 2 28
#ASSERT (`s 10(b), (c) — the last day of a period of` 1 `years after an event on` (YMD 2024 2 29) `, when days of rest, recess or holiday are` `Fridays and Saturdays are days of rest`) EQUALS YMD 2025 3 2

§§ `One month from the day 2025-01-31 (s 10(b)): February 2025 lacks the 31st; the nominal last day is Friday 2025-02-28`

#EVAL `s 10 — the last day of a period of` 1 `months from the day` (YMD 2025 1 31)
#ASSERT (`s 10(b), (c) — the last day of a period of` 1 `months after an event on` (YMD 2025 1 31) `, when days of rest, recess or holiday are` `no days of rest`) EQUALS YMD 2025 2 28
#ASSERT (`s 10(b), (c) — the last day of a period of` 1 `months after an event on` (YMD 2025 1 31) `, when days of rest, recess or holiday are` `Saturdays are days of rest`) EQUALS YMD 2025 2 28
#ASSERT (`s 10(b), (c) — the last day of a period of` 1 `months after an event on` (YMD 2025 1 31) `, when days of rest, recess or holiday are` `Fridays and Saturdays are days of rest`) EQUALS YMD 2025 3 2
